{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, move towards it, take it, and process it. Scan area otherwise. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = MoveTowardsObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectTouchable    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    />\"",
